# 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

## 1.1 Project Introduction

The objective is to design and develop a modern, professional, responsive and visually engaging personal portfolio website for Subham Singh, a first-year college student interested in full-stack web development and artificial intelligence.

The portfolio will act as a digital identity where visitors can explore the owner's background, technical skills, development projects, learning journey and contact information.

The website should demonstrate both technical knowledge and a strong understanding of modern web design.

The visual experience should be inspired by modern SaaS products, developer dashboards, futuristic technology interfaces and professional software developer portfolios.

The website must include a premium dark theme, an elegant light theme, smooth animations, interactive components, responsive layouts and a well-structured multi-page architecture.

## 1.2 Product Vision

Build a premium developer portfolio that represents Subham Singh as an enthusiastic and growing full-stack developer who enjoys building modern web applications and exploring emerging technologies.

The website should communicate:

- Who I am.
- What technologies I work with.
- What I can build.
- What projects I have developed.
- What I am currently learning.
- How visitors can contact or collaborate with me.

## 1.3 Product Mission

Create a professional online presence that helps establish credibility, showcase practical development abilities, attract internship opportunities and connect with other developers.

