# 24. RISKS AND MITIGATION

| Risk | Mitigation |
|---|---|
| Missing project information | Use honest placeholders until real projects are available |
| Overcomplicated design | Prioritize usability and visual hierarchy |
| Slow animations | Use lightweight effects and optimized assets |
| Inconsistent themes | Use centralized CSS design tokens |
| Poor mobile experience | Follow mobile-first development |
| Contact spam | Use server-side validation and rate limits |
| Exposed API credentials | Use protected server environment variables |
| Scope expansion | Keep P2 enhancements outside the first release |
| Difficult maintenance | Use reusable components and structured data |

